 Representative Joe BARTON\u2020- says we ought to start over.] [President BUSH \u2013 says we\u2019re facing a choice between action and the real prospect of economic hardship.] [Senators Harry REID, Mitch McCONNELL\u2020\u2020\u2013 comment on moving the package forward.] [Representative Elijah CUMMINGS\u2020- says we\u2019re worried about folks in my neighborhood.] ", "segment_duration": 260, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 919501, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MbA1Yz821f", "broadcast_date": "2008-09-30", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 919500, "segment_id": "v8OnVEjbPX", "segment_broadcast_id": "MbA1Yz821f", "segment_title": "Money Watch (Oil and Gas Prices) ", "segment_description": "(Studio: Katie Couric) Crude oil and gasoline prices cited.  \n\n(Atlanta: Mark Strassmann) The crisis in the Southeast with high prices and shortages of gas featured; scenes shown of gas lines in Charlotte, North Carolina, and Atlanta, and a Taylorsville, North Carolina, man who was arrested for pulling a gun after being cut off at the pump; details given about the impact of Hurricanes Gustav and Ike on the supply and investigations of price gouging. [2 DRIVERS, Atlanta motorist Ezekiel JILES&#134;, Jagger\u2019s Pizza WORKER \u2013 react.] ", "segment_duration": 120, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63310.0", "legacy_segment_id": 919502, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MbA1Yz821f", "broadcast_date": "2008-09-30", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 919500, "segment_id": "69bk2RUd70", "segment_broadcast_id": "MbA1Yz821f", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Katie Couric) Stock Market Report", "segment_description": " ", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63430.0", "legacy_segment_id": 919503, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MbA1Yz821f", "broadcast_date": "2008-09-30", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 919500, "segment_id": "nCiWNGMNFC", "segment_broadcast_id": "MbA1Yz821f", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Advil; Preparation H; Swanson; NetZero; Reclast; Florida orange juice)", "segment_description": " ", "segment_duration": 150, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "63450.0", "legacy_segment_id": 919504, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "MbA1Yz821f", "broadcast_date": "2008-09-30", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 919500, "segment_id": "BSpLDdFoLu", "segment_broadcast_id": "MbA1Yz821f", "segment_title": "Sarah Palin: Behind 